atus":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1AEAEFDFC13508CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"카프라, 이분은 외부에서 모셔온 마법사 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이셔. <male>그</male><female>그녀</female>가 마법으로 부패를 제거하는 걸 내가 직접 봤어.","female":"카프라, 이분은 외부에서 모셔온 마법사 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님이셔. <male>그</male><female>그녀</female>가 마법으로 부패를 제거하는 걸 내가 직접 봤어.","variant_male_record_index":"108765","variant_female_record_index":"108766","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011608009:1":{"text":"...부패를 제거하다니!","source_cn":"……清除腐化！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF15AD7F8BE957C19","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...부패를 제거하다니!","female":"...부패를 제거하다니!","variant_male_record_index":"108767","variant_female_record_index":"108768","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1011608010:1":{"text":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","source_cn":"竟——竟有如此之能的外乡人！吾等当用最高礼节迎接才是！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EDAE0C25C43F286","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","female":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","variant_male_record_index":"108769","variant_female_record_index":"108770","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1011608010":{"text":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","source_cn":"竟——竟有如此之能的外乡人！吾等当用最高礼节迎接才是！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8EDAE0C25C43F286","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","female":"이... 이런 분을 못 알아뵙다니...! 최고의 예의를 갖추겠습니다!","variant_male_record_index":"108769","variant_female_record_index":"108770","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1011608012:0":{"text":"그러니까, 당신들 말은... 이미르와 한 패가 아니라는 거죠?","source_cn":"所以，听你们的意思……你们和伊米尔不是一伙的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BEA436FA9D76B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1011608013:0":{"text":"저희는 패리사님의 부하입니다. 장관이 퇴임한 후 저희들은 잇달아 전출되어 이곳으로 내려왔습니다.","source_cn":"吾等是帕瑞莎部下。长官离任后，吾等被接连调职，下放于此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE895FE8DEF6B4848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1011608014:1":{"text":"내가 해직된 일에 너희들까지 연루됐단 말이야?!","source_cn":"我被革职，连你们也受牵连了吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0753ED1CF7B79890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011608015:1":{"text":"저희는 가시나무에 충성을 다합니다.\n현자가 어질지 않으니 당연히 바칠 충성도 없죠!","source_cn":"吾等效忠荆棘。\\n贤者不贤，当然无忠可献！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DAF37B4D31718FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011608016:1":{"text":"...그래... 너희가 나보다 더 똑똑히 봤을 테니.","source_cn":"……好……你们看的比我透彻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF235C365568A06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011608017:1":{"text":"장관, 저희는 근처에 재집결했으니 가서 시찰하시고 쉬십시오!","source_cn":"长官，吾等已在附近重新集结，您可前往视察休憩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DA57E8E28F989F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011608018:1":{"text":"브람, 로제타, 찾은 물자를 잘 챙겨서 영지로 돌아가도록!","source_cn":"布拉苜，萝赛塔，收好寻到的物资，列队回营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FCACED01E3CEFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"그럴 필요까진 없어...","source_cn":"那倒是不用了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB51439B532C531","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럴 필요까진 없어...","female":"그럴 필요까진 없어...","variant_male_record_index":"60998","variant_female_record_index":"60999","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011608011:0":{"text":"부디 저의 무례함을 용서해 주십시오!","source_cn":"是，恳请宽恕吾的无礼！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA81CC176A2CFE9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"부디 저의 무례함을 용서해 주십시오!","female":"부디 저의 무례함을 용서해 주십시오!","variant_male_record_index":"108771","variant_female_record_index":"108772","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"제대로 사과해!","source_cn":"要好好向我道歉！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x440133A07A3E4F1D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"제대로 사과해!","female":"제대로 사과해!","variant_male_record_index":"61000","variant_female_record_index":"61001","document_title":"","do